saas-frontend-designer
======================

This plugin includes design-craft material adapted and redistributed from:

  impeccable — https://github.com/pbakaus/impeccable
  Copyright 2025 Paul Bakaus
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The full Apache-2.0 license text is in licenses/impeccable-Apache-2.0.txt.

What was taken: the design-fluency reference library under
skills/baseline-ui/reference/ (audit, craft, layout, typeset, colorize,
interaction-design, distill, harden, bolder, quieter) is redistributed
verbatim from impeccable. The skills/baseline-ui/SKILL.md file was MODIFIED
by MoxyWolf LLC to fold in impeccable's anti-pattern bans, OKLCH color
strategy, typography craft, and two-altitude AI-slop test (per Apache-2.0
section 4(b), modified files are marked as changed).

What was NOT taken: impeccable's live-browser runtime, scripts, hooks,
standalone plugin shell, site, CLI, and extension.

---

This plugin also includes anti-slop design-inference material adapted from:

  taste-skill — https://github.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill
  Copyright (c) 2026 Leonxlnx
  Licensed under the MIT License.

The full MIT license text is in licenses/taste-skill-MIT.txt.

What was taken: the skills/design-taste/SKILL.md gate adapts taste-skill's
Design Read brief-inference, the three dials (DESIGN_VARIANCE / MOTION_INTENSITY
/ VISUAL_DENSITY) with dial inference, the anti-default discipline, and the
em-dash ban. The file is marked as MoxyWolf-adapted at its top.

What was NOT taken: taste-skill's aesthetic-preset skills (minimalist, soft,
brutalist), its redesign and full-output skills, its Stitch and Codex image-to-code
skills, and its image-generation skills (imagegen-web, imagegen-mobile, brandkit).
Those duplicate existing saas-frontend-designer skills or fall outside its scope.
